[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849884335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105943#issuecomment-2849884335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105943","id":2849884335,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p3civ","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T04:32:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T04:32:28Z","body":"I can reproduce it.\n\nI can confirm that `wd.maximized` is not reset to `false` when unmaximizing by clicking the icon. \n\nSet a breakpoint in the following place and click the button (step 4) during debugging to view the properties of `wd`.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1cf573f44de045ee73fd938fbf2bdccc0e31b7bb/platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp#L5171\n\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849884335/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2862254034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105943#issuecomment-2862254034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105943","id":2862254034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qmofS","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-08T08:45:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T08:45:27Z","body":"Another point to note is that enabling the option that calls `OS::get_singleton()->set_low_processor_usage_mode(true);` is also a key step to reproduce the issue.\n\nThat is, you need to enable `application/run/low_processor_mode` in the project settings for a project.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0793c626d2e203c6db04656853f8088478181888/editor/project_manager.cpp#L1309\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0793c626d2e203c6db04656853f8088478181888/editor/editor_node.cpp#L981\n\nThe issue can be reproduced both with the Project Manager and with the editor with `interface/editor/update_continuously` disabled (by default).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2862254034/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2862281395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105943#issuecomment-2862281395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105943","id":2862281395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qmvKz","user":{"login":"mh114","id":149063404,"node_id":"U_kgDOCOKG7A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149063404?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114","html_url":"https://github.com/mh114","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mh114/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-08T08:55:36Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T08:55:36Z","body":"> Another point to note is that enabling the option that calls `OS::get_singleton()->set_low_processor_usage_mode(true);` is also a key step to reproduce the issue.\n\nGood find, didn't expect that to matter! Now I'm not sure if I tested without it when creating the MRP (and just forgot to mention it), or if I enabled the low processor mode immediately, as my actual app does use it.. 🤔\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos